nd  and um again just a little glimpse of  the trauma that uh  stemmed from that very very  dysfunctional relationship she was in  i love that scene i was just like  cringing the whole time in all the right  ways i loved it so much  and um for david i've said this on many  youtube videos  you're like the king of appearing in  comic book properties  and i'm so happy you've crafted a  character but we only barely got to  scratch the surface of in terms of  backstory  but like everyone i've talked to you  were all shades of sympathetic you're  weird as hell but badass when you  shouted  i'm a superhero i just had this big grit  on my face  but i thought the past we hinted at  entailed so much weird but  cool sci-fi body horror trauma stuff and  we didn't get to see the kind of life  that this character had that led him to  being captured by waller  would you want to do a standalone movie  and if so what would you  really like to explore about his  backstory  thanks for saying that and i god i loved  getting doing body abner and getting to  bring him to life and james wrote such a  complex and beautiful character with him  and as someone who loves and appreciates  comic books i do think that  it can be such a great lens when you  tell these big stories with cinema  for going to some dark and interesting  places when people  least expect that to occur so  if we were to go further back into  abner's past one of the things that  is really funny funny whatever is the  right word but james didn't know this  about me  when i was a kid i was diagnosed with an  autoimmune disorder called vitiligo and  i have it to this day and i have spots  all over my body and it was something  that  riddled me with anxiety and paranoia and  like just completely being so  embarrassed of my body  literally until about 12 years ago when  i met my wife who just thought that my  spots were the coolest thing  but i would love to tell the story about  that journey like young abner up to  um you know because because his are just  these more  visceral manifestations of something  that i feel like i really get you know  and it has to star actually harley but  let abner be in it  i i'll just i'll be i'll be a supporting  character  i love that um thank you guys both so  much i love the hell out of this movie  and you were the two that i requested to  talk with so  i feel like i won the lottery just now  thank you both so much enjoy the rest of  the wedding  thank you so much please congratulate  them from us okay  they'll see you jake thank you guys  take care  you

